<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">1 BaTesaloni</para>
  <para style="toc3">1BaTe</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 BaTesaloni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aTesaloni</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 BaTesaloni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aTesaloni</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Show yin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni mi, aBulus, aSilas nɛ aTimoti sak ni yin bafi ikuus fi i se yin na baTesaloni, banet Ada Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. Won itek Adakunom ni kusot kukyang ni ku di nak ni iyin.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifeng fin bɛ́ yit <optbreak /> nek inɔɔk atsak <optbreak /> banet aTesaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />In nyes yit ifeng na Adakunom kaakyi izen mok iyin, in ki tes yin ayɛt awon yit. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Kaakyi izen in yiring yit ni yin ashon Adakunom, ni ntomong inɔɔk atsak yin, ni mgbang fi i se yin ne nek ishim, ni inye nyɛk, fi ite iyɛ yin ayɛt aTisa aYeso Kristi bɛ́s e.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Nek iyit rēn yit fok, Adakunom ki shim yin ábaruneng, a mi ki kasa yin, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek yit bɛ ni yin, ayɛt ncɛɛt kyek awo, tit ayɛt kukyem, nɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ, ni itonoso atsak kayɛt iyɛ. Iyin rēn yin kuri kusot fi in nye yit nate yin nek itek yin, <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />iyin mi kuus yin ane yit nɛ afɛ́ aTisa, ngma ni izot fi i se yin ne, ishan yin ifɛ̀ me ni itɛrɛk iyɛ fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ ki nɔɔk yin. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Nek ikyɛng fi i nye yin, i sot yin ikyɛng imɛɛs ni ishɛrɛp bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aMasedoniya nɛ Akaya.<verse eid="1TH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ifɛ̀ aTisa fi i ne ni yin mi tseng sak na aMasedoniya nɛ Akaya kyek awo, kucɛɛt inɔɔk atsak yin na Adakunom mi tseng kaakyɛ, nek anɔng, ma in tin fɛ̀ yit ikyikak naton e awo, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />nek iba ice bá, ba taas kuri ishan fi iyin ki nye yit ne. Ba taas kuri itirik fi i nye yin, fi i wosong yin nabannom yin, sak iya ntong na Adakunom atsak fɛ́ a yet atset, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />ni kusot ite iyɛ ma Ari wu fɛ́ a bi ne azanɛn ne, ayɔng fi iwu kin ku donong ni irɛk, aYeso. Iwu fɛ́ a ki tun yit ni izot fi iwuruk.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kutomong aBulus <optbreak /> na aTesaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Iyin rēn yin ábaruneng, fok itsen fi in kin ki bɛ́ yin ne, i kin yet ifɛ́ abap awo. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ngma ni izot ni itok fin in kin sɔ yit na aFilipi, kyɔn ti iyin di rēn yin, ngma na anɔng, in sɛs yit agap na Adakunom yit, fi in ki tas yin mo ifɛ̀ itek, ngma ni iraye fi in sɛs yit. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Nek itabak fi iyit mi ki nye yin ne, yet ifi mbɔɔs kɛ iyiring imaan e awo, kɛ nek in tsɛt yit in ki gorok yin awo. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Anɔng awo, kucɛɛt yit yet kufɛ́ banet fɛ́ Adakunom mi di te ncicɛ wu, fɛ́ ba di sak iyɛ nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek. In tsin tsɛt yit in tɛrɛk yit banet iyɛ awo, tit Adakunom fɛ́ a mara ayɛ yit. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Iyin rēn yin fok, iyit kin ra yit kutomong na arɔtɔt anu kɛ in nɛt yit nse yit mok in ki mɔɔt yin mo awo, Adakunom rēn anɔng. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Iyit kin tsɛt yit itere banet awo, kɛ ni yin kɛ na akak awo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:6">Tɛ batom aYeso, zɔng ki kunanang yit se naton yin. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ngma na anɔng, tɛ batom aKristi, in kin ki bereng yin hwyɛ, kpaf tɛ anyi nggon di berese nabin nnon wu. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />In ki shim yin gyet awo, fi isak ayɛt itɛrɛk iyɛ in nyeseng yit ni ishara ifɛ̀ Adakunom kyek awo, in nɔɔk yit kutset yit bà, nek iyin mi ki nɔ yit ni iyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ábaruneng, in rēn fok, i rēn yiring yin kutomong ni mgbang fi in sɔ yit, in ras yit kutomong e katuk ni kunom, kɔng in bi sot yit kunanang na akak ni izen ishara ifɛ̀ Adakunom sak ni yin.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Iyin ice yin da kyem itak yin, Adakunom ice wu da kyem a cɛɛt akuce yit, kuri kusot aJɛrɛ, ni kusot kutabat yit, ni kusot avit inɛn fi in nye yit, ni iyin bafi inɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Iyin rēn yin fok, in nye yit kusot yit ni iyin tɛ ada di nyes ni nnon wu, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />in ki gbingding yin, ni in ki tabak yin, ni in nye ni iyin, ni i nye yin kusot fi ku se gyat ashon Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a ki yes yin sak ayɛt igwɔm ni ízɔk wu.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Nek anɔng wu fi in nesek yit ifeng na Adakunom kaakyi izen, nek nkum fi i kin di shan yin ifɛ̀ Adakunom, fi i kin fok yin ni yit, i kin shan yin ide ti ifɛ̀ anet awe awo, tit ti ifɛ̀ Adakunom fi i se ni kutomong ayɛt yin bafi inɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Ábaruneng, nek iyin mi sot yin bafi imɛɛs nggɔn banet Adakunom ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso fɛ́ ba se na aJudiya. I sɔ yin izot ni bɔk bafi mben yin, kpaf tɛ fi bafi ikuus e yɔng kin di sɔ izot ni bɔk baYahuda, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />fɛ́ ba fɛt aTisa yit aYeso, nɛ batan, ama anɔng ba ki tun yit amatse. Ba beseng Adakunom iyɛ, ba se ni ifà na banet ngma kusum <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />ba nye nyɛk fok ba ki ro yit ni ishara ifɛ̀ sak ni Ícɛn-iduk kɔn ba bi sɛ isheshek. Nek anɔng wu, ba di tusung ice bà inɛn. Kafa kawe Adakunom bi tik ni ba ni igang e.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus ya iyɛ kudi <optbreak /> banet aTesaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Awɛt ábaruneng, neme fi in kana kam yit, (ni rɔm da ni kuyiring awo) in fi kizen gyeet, in ti in sɛ yit kudi yin awo, in bɛ̀ yit iyɛ ngash, in ya yit iyɛ makiyi ki in mi bɛ́ in ki di yin. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Nek in tsɛt yit irèn in bi in ki di yin, amak e imi aBulus mi tsɛt in bɛ́ izen dot, awɛt aShetan di tɛnɛsɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Nek akyɛ de fi i yet ite iyɛ yit, ni ifeng yit, nɛ abong ízɔk fi in bi di nye yit mgbep ashon aTisa yit aYeso nizen kubɛ́ wu, ke da a yet iyin awɛ? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Na tsak, iyin ba i yet yin ízɔk ni mgbep yit.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Nek anɔng, fi in di yit, in da kyem in tot yit awo, in di yit i se gyat ba ki won yit na Atena me aziyit. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />In yirik yit aTimoti, aruneng yit nɛ afidang yit ni tomong Adakunom ayɛt ishara ifɛ̀ itek ifɛ́ Anet-Isheshek, na bɛ́ a ki gyerep yin, na bang gbinding inɔɔk atsak yin, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />kɔn ndiri-ndiri mgbang nang bi sak akak na won irèn. Iyin rēn yin tsɛngtsɛng fok i se gbing ni in sɔ yit ina. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Atsak e yet fok, nizen fi in se yit azɔng ni yin, in sɔ ni in ki tas yin fok ba da ki nesek yit izot. I kin te kpaf anɔng, ti iyin da rēn yin. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Nek anɔng, fi in kyem in yit ice min awo, in sak na ba bɛ ba di rip kukyang inɔɔk atsak yin. Nnyim hom yet fok nyen afi imara me mi ki kɔrɔk yin, a mi te kutomong yit sot abap.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itom fɛ́ aTimoti ne ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Awɛt aTimoti yɔng a ne azɔng narɔ yin, a ki bɛ́ yit ni ifɛ̀ itek naton atsak ni itonoso ishim yin. A fɛ̀ ni yit fok iyiring yin ni yit gyet awo, ye fok a ki se yin ki i mi ki di yit, kyɔn ti fi iyit di foos yit ikɔk idi yin bà. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng, ngma ni mgbang ni izot fi in se yit ne, in sɛs yit agap iyɛ nek inɔɔk atsak yin. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Yɔkɔnɔng wu in da bang sɛ yit nta kusot e, ayet fok iyin rēn se yin ni nyeseng gak ni kuus Adakunom. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Akyɛ kuri ifeng fi in da nye yit Adakunom ne nek itɛrɛk iyɛ fi in bɛ̀ yit nanu ashon wu nek iyin ɛ? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Kunom na katuk, in ras yit awon makiyi fok in sɛ yit irèn in ti ki di yin, nɔng in ki nɔɔk yin ikyɛng fi i se vit ayɛt inɔɔk atsak yin.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Won Adakunom nɛ Ada yit ikyɛng wu, nɛ aTisa yit aYeso, na ki tarak yit irèn ibɛ́ azɔng ni yin. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Won aTisa na sak itonoso ishim yin ni bang di barasa juut-juut sak na bafidang, ni ishɛrɛp banet, kyɔn ti fi ifiit di tsees ni yin. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Won na bang ki barang yin mo agap iyɛ nɔng in da sot yit vit inɛn, nɛ aJɛrɛ nanu ashon Adakunom nɛ Ada nizen fɛ́ aTisa aYeso bi bɛ́s wu nɛ bafɛ́ aJɛrɛ wu. Anɔng!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kusot fi ku tɛrɛk <optbreak /> Adakunom iyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ni gang e, ábaruneng, in tsin ki nɔɔk yin itabak irèn fi i da nye yin kusot fi ku da tɛrɛk Adakunom iyɛ, kyɔn ti kusot fi i se yin ne. Yɔkɔnɔng in fɛ̀ ni yin, in tsin ki tak yin ni yerek aTisa yit aYeso ni i ya yin kashon na anɔng. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Iyin rēn yin itabak fi in man ki nɔk yin ne na aTisa yit aYeso.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Ayet ishim Adakunom fok ni se yin cɛ́l, fok ni teng yin kujang; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />fok kaangan yin na a tekap kurɔm wu ni irèn fi i se jɛrɛ fɛ́ Adakunom shim, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />da i bi won yin kurɔm ki kɔk yin ti Ícɛn-iduk fɛ́ da ba rēn Adakunom awo; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />azaton ifɛ̀ deng, won akak bi beseng kɛ na mɔɔt arunyining awo. Adakunom bi tabak ngma banet fɛ́ ba nyes kuri anɛn nang, kyɔn ti in kin di fɛ̀ yit ni yin, in ki kɔrɔk yin kuto. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nek Adakunom ki yes yit ni nyes yit nggɔn nsum awo tit sak ni kusot ku jɛrɛ me. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Nek anɔng, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu itabak yeng, a rawu itabak anet awe awo tit ifɛ́ Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a ki nɔk yin Kabik aJɛrɛ wu.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Naton ishim bafidiin, da ma in ti in jɛk yin ne awo, nek iyin ice yin mi sɛ yin itees Adakunom. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Atsak e yet, iyin tsin tonoso yin ishim sak na barunyining fɛ́ ba se kaakɛ na aMasedoniya. Ngma na anɔng, in tsin bang ki tak yin fok ni ya yin kashon na anɔng ábaruneng.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Won nggɔn yin ni in sot nfi nhwyɛ, sak nhwyɛ ni ira ikyɛng ibɔk ngɔn, ra kutomong ni mbɔk ngɔn, kyɔn ti fi in kin di fɛ̀ ni yin, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />nɔng kusot atut na katson yin ni ku yet ikyɛng itere na ba fɛ̀ amatse, kɔn i bi sot yin kunanang na bakak awo.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubun aTisa yit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Ábaruneng, iyit shim ni sot yin vit irēn azaton bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi men nda awo, ki ni nye yin kafa kawe ti ishɛrɛp banet fɛ́ ba se vit ite iyɛ awo. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Iyit nɔɔk yit atsak fok aYeso ku a tɛ dorok na anɔng in bɛ̀ yit atsak fok Adakunom bi bɛ́ na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni nda gung na aYeso. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Kpaf ti ifɛ̀ aTisa, won in ki tak yin, iyit fi in se yit ni kutset, fi in bi resek yit sak izen kubɛ́ aTisa, ko ni kuro, in bi ya yit kashon bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi men nda awo. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Nek aTisa ice wu, bi ne azanɛn, ni kukun ku gbɛrɛy, ni kutɔ agbat atomaza ni kugba Adakunom, bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku ayɛt Anet-Isheshek bi tin dorok. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ama anɔng, iyit fi in se ni kutset, fi in resek yit, ba bi ki sok yit gung ni ba sak ayɛt anɔk ni in nyim yit na aTisa naton aza. Na anɔng, in bi sot yit gung na aTisa ayɛ na ayɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Nek anɔng, nye gbinding yin bafidang ni ifɛ̀ deng.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng ábaruneng, naton izen ni nkɔs nnom, fi nkyɔrɔk nang bi te, i se gbing ma in ki jɛk yin ne awo, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />nek iyin rēn yin tsɛngtsɛng fok kunom Adakunom bi bɛ tɛ akpatang di bes natuk. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ni izen fɛ́ banet tsin nye, &lt;&lt;Kukyang ni imen iyɛ,&gt;&gt; wat gobok ni imaan e ka ba kpa, kpaf tɛ mgbang ites di kpa abin afa, ni ihwyet ka ba gaat.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Awɛt ábaruneng iyin se yin ayɛt idun e, fi kunom e da ki sok yin amakɔt tɛ akpatang di bɛ́s banet awo. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ngma yin i yet yin nnon mgbey ni nnon kunom. Iyit yet yit bafɛ́ atuk kɛ bafɛ́ ahwyi awo. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Nek anɔng, won in bi sot yit ti ishɛrɛp e yɔng fɛ́ ba se ni nda awo, tit ni in kana nye yit, in tekap yit kurɔm yit. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni nda, ba mereng natuk, bayɔng fɛ́ ba sɔs na ba feng, ba feng na atuk. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Awɛt iyit yet yit bafi inom, won ni in tekap yit nrɔm yit, won atsak ni ishim ni i sot tɛ akpara-gwɔm yit, ni ite iyɛ isɛ isheshek sot tɛ abong ni ice yit, <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nek Adakunom ki sak yit mok iyɔm nɛ kafa kawe wu awo tit nek in sɛ yit isheshek ni bɔk aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Iwu ku nek iyit nɔng kɛ ni in se yit ni ishemeng kɛ ni nda ayi, ni in se yit gung ni iwu. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Nek anɔng, kana gbinding yin ni kana nok yin kpaf ti fi i se yin ne.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itabak igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Yɔkɔnɔng in shim in fɛ̀ ni yin ane ábaruneng, nesek yin bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin bɔrɔng ni kutomong nate yin iratek, iba fɛ́ aTisa ka ba sak iyɛrɛ yin na ba ki gyɔs yin. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Kaba bereng yin ayɛt iratek makiyi, ni ka ba tonoso yin ishim nek kutomong bá. Sot yin kyang na bafidang. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Won in ki tak yin ábaruneng, tabak yin bafɛ́ arut, gbinding yin bafi nnyim, di sɛs yin bafi kurat, nye yin akabɔk na akaangan. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Da akak na a tarang akak na anyas awo, tit na a nye nyɛk, nye yin itek sak na bafidang ni ishɛrɛp banet.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Nye yin kafa kakan kaakyi izen; <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />ya yin kashon na awon; <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />nesek yin ifeng na akaakyi ikyɛng, nek anɔng wu fɛ́ Adakunom shim ni yin fi i se yin na Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />I bi fɛt yin kurong abik awo; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />i bi byɛs yin itaas-ibes awo. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Mara yin kaakyɛ. Bereng yin ikyɛng fi i yet itek. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Rayin kaakyɛ fi i yet imaan e.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Won Adakunom ice wu, ki sak yin ni sot yin jɛrɛ, na a ya kashon a ki tes yin jɛrɛ. Won kabik yin ngma kusum ni kutset yin ni kurɔm yin ni in sot vit ibeseng sak ni izen ibɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Nek iwu yɔng fɛ́ a ki yes yin, yet afi ifɛ̀ ni ishining, a da shining ifɛ̀ wu.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Ábaruneng, ki ras yit awon. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Te show ngma bafi ikuus ni kuri ishim bafi ikuus. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />In ra awon ni yin ni iyerek aTisa, sak yin na ba fa kufumung kang sak na baruneng ngma kusum.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Won itek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni i sot gung ni yin.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>